  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Konsultst&#xf6;d upphandlades f&#xf6;r resultatskrift &quot;Documentation of the Swedish CSO Cooperation in Ethiopia from 2004-2013&quot; genom tidigare kontrakt med Donald Bostr&#xf6;m AB i enlighet med kontrakt nr. C02324. D&#xe5; f&#xe4;rdigst&#xe4;llandet av skriften kr&#xe4;vt l&#xe4;ngre tid &#xe4;n ber&#xe4;knat.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Embassy of Sweden had signed a contract with Donald Bostr&#xf6;m AB in 2013 to publish book on the CSO support. Books are finalized and ready to be delivered and final payment is requested by the firm.</narrative>
